WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.625 --> 00:00:16.287
Gently, very carefully, Dr.

2
00:00:16.327 --> 00:00:18.128
Dolittle walked over to the man.

3
00:00:18.949 --> 00:00:21.010
Just then his match went out again.

4
00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:23.372
"Get away from me, Ben Ali!"

5
00:00:23.792 --> 00:00:24.593
shouted the man.

6
00:00:25.233 --> 00:00:27.195
He thought it was a Barbary pirate.

7
00:00:27.215 --> 00:00:30.225
"Wait! I'm not Ben Ali!"

8
00:00:30.585 --> 00:00:31.785
Dr. Dolittle cried.

9
00:00:31.805 --> 00:00:34.406
"Who are you then?"

10
00:00:34.967 --> 00:00:36.287
asked the man with red hair.

11
00:00:36.307 --> 00:00:38.968
"My name is John Dolittle.

12
00:00:39.349 --> 00:00:42.750
And your nephew is with me," explained the doctor.

13
00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:45.671
The man's eyes filled with tears.

14
00:00:45.691 --> 00:00:47.212
"My dear nephew!

15
00:00:47.772 --> 00:00:48.352
Where is he?"

16
00:00:50.273 --> 00:00:52.514
Dr. Dolittle led the man out the hole.

17
00:00:53.234 --> 00:00:55.735
The boy was so happy to see his uncle.

18
00:00:57.220 --> 00:01:00.783
"Jip, I'm sorry I didn't believe you," Gub-Gub cried.

19
00:01:00.803 --> 00:01:03.085
"We're all sorry!"

20
00:01:03.765 --> 00:01:04.766
cried Dab-Dab.

21
00:01:04.786 --> 00:01:08.088
"You're the smartest dog in the world!"

22
00:01:08.809 --> 00:01:10.070
all the animals shouted.

23
00:01:12.732 --> 00:01:14.573
The uncle explained what had happened.

24
00:01:14.593 --> 00:01:18.896
"Ben Ali put me on this island because I didn't want to be a pirate.

25
00:01:19.517 --> 00:01:21.018
I had no food or water.

26
00:01:21.518 --> 00:01:23.820
I lived on pickles and lemons for four days!"

27
00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:31.842
The man and his nephew lived in a fishing village.

28
00:01:32.803 --> 00:01:35.405
Dr. Dolittle sailed the ship toward their home.

29
00:01:35.425 --> 00:01:37.807
"There! There is my village!

30
00:01:38.208 --> 00:01:39.629
And up there is my house!"

31
00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:42.071
the man pointed excitedly.

32
00:01:43.592 --> 00:01:46.435
In the village, a woman spotted the red sails.

33
00:01:46.455 --> 00:01:48.596
"It's the Barbary pirates!

34
00:01:48.917 --> 00:01:49.877
It's Ben Ali!

35
00:01:50.118 --> 00:01:52.259
HELP!" she screamed.

36
00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:54.782
People came running toward the beach.

37
00:01:55.522 --> 00:01:57.424
It was indeed the Barbary ship.

38
00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:02.282
The people of the village were ready to fight the pirates.

39
00:02:02.302 --> 00:02:04.584
"Mommy! It's me!"

40
00:02:05.304 --> 00:02:06.505
the little boy shouted.

41
00:02:06.525 --> 00:02:08.727
"What? Can it be?

42
00:02:08.747 --> 00:02:10.688
Oh, my baby!"

43
00:02:11.469 --> 00:02:12.209
cried the woman.

44
00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:18.554
Of course no pirates got off the ship—only the boy, his uncle, Dr.

45
00:02:18.594 --> 00:02:20.215
Dolittle and his animals.

46
00:02:21.436 --> 00:02:24.338
The boy's mother was the sister of the red-haired man.

47
00:02:24.938 --> 00:02:27.420
Dr. Dolittle and his animals stayed with them.

48
00:02:28.176 --> 00:02:29.517
The boy was her son.

49
00:02:30.537 --> 00:02:33.839
The boy and his uncle told the village people what had happened.

50
00:02:33.859 --> 00:02:35.479
"That's how Dr.

51
00:02:35.519 --> 00:02:37.360
Dolittle got the Barbary ship!"

52
00:02:37.980 --> 00:02:38.621
said the boy.

53
00:02:38.641 --> 00:02:41.542
"Then where is Ben Ali now?"

54
00:02:42.082 --> 00:02:42.942
asked a villager.

55
00:02:42.962 --> 00:02:48.105
"He is on an island, where he is living as a farmer," replied the doctor.

56
00:02:48.125 --> 00:02:52.606
"Ben Ali, the great Barbary pirate, is now a farmer?

57
00:02:56.388 --> 00:02:57.949
Ha-ha-ha! Three cheers for Dr.

58
00:02:57.989 --> 00:03:01.152
Dolittle, who saved us from Ben Ali!"

59
00:03:03.634 --> 00:03:05.115
laughed the other village people.

60
00:03:06.897 --> 00:03:09.679
After two days, it was time to leave the village.

61
00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:11.801
The mayor gave Dr.

62
00:03:11.861 --> 00:03:12.881
Dolittle a gift.

63
00:03:13.582 --> 00:03:17.665
"To the brave man who rescued us from pirates, Dr.

64
00:03:17.745 --> 00:03:19.086
Dolittle," said the mayor.

65
00:03:19.587 --> 00:03:21.588
He handed the doctor a small box.

66
00:03:22.489 --> 00:03:25.632
Inside was a beautiful pearl and diamond watch.

67
00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:28.321
"Oh, my!

68
00:03:28.921 --> 00:03:30.962
Thank you very much," Dr.

69
00:03:31.022 --> 00:03:32.102
Dolittle exclaimed.

70
00:03:33.163 --> 00:03:34.723
The mayor took another box.

71
00:03:35.384 --> 00:03:36.684
"Where is the dog?"

72
00:03:37.065 --> 00:03:37.625
he asked.

73
00:03:38.385 --> 00:03:40.606
Inside the box was a gold collar.

74
00:03:40.626 --> 00:03:43.728
"For the bravest dog in the world!"

75
00:03:44.268 --> 00:03:45.128
the mayor said.

76
00:03:47.229 --> 00:03:49.270
Everyone in the village waved good-bye.

77
00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:51.611
"Have a safe journey!"

78
00:03:52.352 --> 00:03:52.972
they shouted.

79
00:03:53.661 --> 00:03:57.137
They watched as the red sails disappeared across the waters.
